23 Fleet
********

‘M-x harmless-team-fleet’ shows one rig.  The view has three parts.
Topology is the launch order and the edges.  Health is each seat and,
beside those seats, each service.  People is the rows waiting on a
person.  A parked row with no summary is not in that list.

   The session dashboard still lists sessions by project.  The fleet
buffer is ‘*harmless-fleet*’.  It is not that dashboard.  The command
writes nothing and starts nothing.

   Nil, ‘""’, and whitespace are refused: ‘team rig is empty’.  A
missing rig is refused: ‘team rig is missing’.  The filesystem root is
refused: ‘Refusing to store a team at ’, followed by that directory.


