25 Context
**********

A project holds context packs under ‘packs/NAME/PACK.md’.  ‘M-x
harmless-context-list’ reads the pack names.  A missing ‘packs’
directory is an empty list, and it is not created.  ‘M-x
harmless-context-show’ reads the manifest.  ‘M-x harmless-context-get’
reads a ref.  A ref is a pack, one file in that pack, or one heading in
that file.  A heading matches its text or its slug, and the section
includes its subsections.  ‘M-x harmless-context-profile’ composes the
pieces the manifest declares for ‘fresh’, ‘handover’, or
‘post-compaction’.  The piece list is not chosen at the call.  Four
characters are one token.  The total covers the whole text.  A positive
budget reports how far that total is over.  The text is not cut.
Nothing is written, and nothing is started.

   ‘PACK.md’ starts with ‘# Files’ and the member files.  ‘# fresh’, ‘#
handover’, and ‘# post-compaction’ then list pieces.  A piece is a
member file, or that file and a heading: ‘notes.md#Start’.

   Nil, ‘""’, and whitespace are refused: ‘context project is empty’.  A
project that is not text is refused: ‘context project must be a string’.
‘/’ and a drive root are refused: ‘context project is the filesystem
root’.  A relative project, including ‘~’, is refused and is not
expanded: ‘context project must be absolute’.  A missing project is
refused: ‘context project is missing’.  A file is refused: ‘context
project is not a directory’.

   Nil, ‘""’, and whitespace are refused: ‘context pack is empty’.  A
pack that is not text is refused: ‘context pack must be a string’.  Any
other pack is refused: ‘context pack is not a name’.  A missing pack is
refused: ‘context pack is missing’.  A manifest that cannot be read is
refused: ‘context pack is not valid’.  That file is left unchanged.  A
member that leaves the pack is refused: ‘context file escapes the pack’.
A missing member is refused: ‘context file is missing’.  A directory is
refused: ‘context file is not a file’.  A file that the manifest does
not list is refused: ‘context file is not in the pack’.  A missing
heading is refused: ‘context section is missing’.

   Nil, ‘""’, and whitespace are refused: ‘context ref is empty’.  A ref
that is not text is refused: ‘context ref must be a string’.  Any other
ref is refused: ‘context ref is not a ref’.  Nil, ‘""’, and whitespace
are refused: ‘context situation is empty’.  A situation that is not text
is refused: ‘context situation must be a string’.  Any other situation
is refused: ‘context situation is not a situation’.  A situation the
pack does not declare is refused: ‘context situation is missing’.  Zero,
a negative number, and any other budget are refused: ‘context budget is
not a budget’.  Omitting the budget reports zero overage.

   A context path at the filesystem root is refused: ‘Refusing to read
context at ’, followed by that path.


