*******

‘M-x harmless-menu’ opens a transient with the common commands.  You can
also open it with ‘m’ in the transcript or ‘C-c C-k’ in the prompt.

‘n’
     New session.

‘C’
     Detached chat.

‘c’
     Current project.

‘s’
     Switch session.

‘d’
